Package: nido-ime-bridge
Version: 0.2.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libibus-1.0-5 (>= 1.5.25), vielotus (>= 2.0.11)
Recommends: ibus
Maintainer: Nido Holdings <support@nido-holdings.com>
Homepage: https://nido-holdings.com
Description: NidoOS zero-underline IBus bridge for Sen Viet (VieLotusIM)
 Native IBus engine for NidoOS that dynamically loads libVieLotusCAPI.so.0
 from upstream vielotus (>= 2.0.11) and commits Vietnamese diacritics directly
 without ever activating IBus/Wayland preedit underlines.
 .
 Delivers full VieLotusIM v2.0.11 parity (bilingual VI/EN UI & IBus menu,
 mid-word surrounding adoption, VNI numpad digits, XKB combining-mark NFC
 normalization, per-app typing-modes.yml passthrough rules, inline/fenced
 Developer Mode) plus NidoOS customizations (Teal-Slate Bento Settings UI,
 post-commit BackSpace rehydration, mouse-click cursor-jump guard, and
 ordered zero-race Backspace + commit pipeline) while preserving conflict-free
 APT upgrades via dpkg-divert.
